<title>{5MasterCode</title>
<link>http://xs.xploder.net/xploder/xploderui.asp?un=xdnv2&amp;platformid=1&amp;tab=gc&amp;gameid=13726</link>
<description>The Cheats I have for this game are in game ones activated with a button press at the menu screen.  Activating these cheats sets flags in a 16bit bitfield  Wrote a routine to generate the bitfield, using individual bytes in kernel space to represent the cheat being on / off.  Hijacked a spare NOP in the joypad read function to call this routine.</description>
